.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Fallen_Leaf_Lake_and_Lake_Tahoe_South_Shore.jpg/500px-Fallen_Leaf_Lake_and_Lake_Tahoe_South_Shore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fallen Leaf Lake and Lake Tahoe in background from Angora Ridge Rd. to the Angora Lakes Resort","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFallen_Leaf_Lake_and_Lake_Tahoe_South_Shore.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Sockeye_salmon_jumping_over_beaver_dam_Lake_Aleknagik%2C_AK_Kristina_Ramstad_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Sockeye_salmon_jumping_over_beaver_dam_Lake_Aleknagik%2C_AK_Kristina_Ramstad_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Sockeye salmon (aka Kokanee salmon in Lake Tahoe) jumping a five-foot beaver dam ","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASockeye_salmon_jumping_over_beaver_dam_Lake_Aleknagik%2C_AK_Kristina_Ramstad_1997.jpg"}],"sounds":{"snow":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/En-uk-snow.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/96/En-uk-snow.ogg/En-uk-snow.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/En-us-snow.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/En-us-snow.ogg/En-us-snow.ogg.mp3"}]}}}